WEBVTT

00:00:00.920 --> 00:00:02.500
Neutral Realm Island,

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:03.850
a tropical paradise.

00:00:06.550 --> 00:00:10.990
The island is a resort area that 
belongs to none of the Six Powers,

00:00:10.990 --> 00:00:12.950
and remains a permanent neutral zone.

00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:17.770
The people say that the very existence 
of this island is a message of peace

00:00:17.770 --> 00:00:20.410
and a vow of pacifism to the whole world.

00:00:20.840 --> 00:00:24.020
It's wonderful that a place 
like that exists, isn't it?

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:27.190
And now we're there, and we're about...

00:00:27.190 --> 00:00:29.790
...to forget about our tough jobs.

00:00:29.790 --> 00:00:30.420
We're here to work.

00:00:32.490 --> 00:00:34.880
W-Wait a second!

00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:37.090
I thought this was a vacation!

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:39.920
This is our income statement 
up through last month.

00:00:39.920 --> 00:00:43.200
We're doing the quests we get, but the gap 
between the rewards and our fixed expenses

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:44.810
is so high that we're
 basically running on credit.

00:00:45.080 --> 00:00:48.200
At this rate, there's no way in hell we'll 
ever be able to rebuild the Branch Office.

00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:50.840
Don't you think, Gajeru?

00:00:50.840 --> 00:00:53.660
But that's not my fault!

00:00:53.660 --> 00:00:56.800
By the way, you sure expense 
a lot of things, don't you?

00:00:56.800 --> 00:01:00.410
I've heard your room is turning 
bluer and bluer by the day.

00:01:00.670 --> 00:01:04.210
Does that have anything to do 
with it, you think, Gajeru?

00:01:07.570 --> 00:01:10.420
Anyway, I'll tell you what 
you're all going to be doing.

00:01:10.690 --> 00:01:12.400
Haru, you're a lifeguard!

00:01:13.290 --> 00:01:15.010
C-Can I do such an important job?

00:01:15.290 --> 00:01:17.410
Gajeru and Liza, the food stand!

00:01:17.410 --> 00:01:20.320
When did we open a food stand?

00:01:20.320 --> 00:01:21.430
And Campanella...

00:01:21.900 --> 00:01:23.780
Hi, everyone!

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:26.270
It's me, Campanella!

00:01:26.700 --> 00:01:30.230
Who wants to take a photo with me?

00:01:30.730 --> 00:01:33.650
It's just 30,000 zel for a photo.

00:01:33.650 --> 00:01:34.170
Smooch.

00:01:36.030 --> 00:01:37.100
I'll take one!

00:01:37.100 --> 00:01:38.280
I'll take one!

00:01:38.280 --> 00:01:39.620
I'll go get some money out of the ATM!

00:01:40.710 --> 00:01:42.960
So she's selling herself, huh?

00:01:42.960 --> 00:01:46.210
Isn't 30,000 zel pretty expensive?

00:01:46.960 --> 00:01:48.660
That's what photo shoots usually cost.

00:01:48.660 --> 00:01:49.630
Really?

00:01:49.630 --> 00:01:51.010
Oh, fine.

00:01:51.010 --> 00:01:52.460
Time to get to work, I guess.

00:01:52.460 --> 00:01:54.800
By the way, what will 
you be doing, Erika-san?

00:01:55.880 --> 00:01:57.890
Huh? Erika-san?

00:01:57.890 --> 00:01:59.880
I found your lost child.

00:01:59.880 --> 00:02:01.430
My child!

00:02:01.430 --> 00:02:03.070
We've been looking everywhere for him!

00:02:03.070 --> 00:02:04.640
Thank you!

00:02:04.920 --> 00:02:06.280
She's helping people!

00:02:06.280 --> 00:02:07.360
Way to go, boss!

00:02:07.360 --> 00:02:09.200
Please let us thank you!

00:02:09.200 --> 00:02:10.840
My husband is very wealthy.

00:02:10.840 --> 00:02:12.840
No, there's no need for that...

00:02:13.360 --> 00:02:14.230
I'll take 100,000 zel, then!

00:02:15.360 --> 00:02:16.740
She took the money!

00:02:16.740 --> 00:02:18.400
Way to go, boss...

00:02:41.550 --> 00:02:44.930
<b>~ the journey to the end of the despair ~</b>

00:03:48.990 --> 00:03:52.620
<b>Episode 8: Swimsuit Episode</b>

00:03:49.730 --> 00:03:51.220
Welcome!

00:03:51.220 --> 00:03:55.500
Sit down, have some food, and relax 
here at the Arc End Beach House!

00:03:55.700 --> 00:03:57.920
Welcome, welcome!

00:03:57.920 --> 00:03:59.710
How about a bite to eat?

00:04:01.160 --> 00:04:05.150
I thought I'd completed my 
"travel around the world" ritual,

00:04:05.150 --> 00:04:07.300
but I forgot about Neutral Realm Island!

00:04:07.690 --> 00:04:11.330
And why is everyone so underdressed?

00:04:11.330 --> 00:04:13.490
I've never worn a swimsuit before,

00:04:13.490 --> 00:04:16.480
and it's really scary to 
have so much skin exposed!

00:04:16.480 --> 00:04:18.260
And I'm hungry, too!

00:04:18.260 --> 00:04:21.560
And I know just the thing 
to help you, reindeer girl!

00:04:21.560 --> 00:04:22.860
Somebody talked to me!

00:04:22.860 --> 00:04:26.160
Yakisoba, ice cream, 
snow cones... we've got it all!

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:27.610
Come right this way!

00:04:27.610 --> 00:04:29.760
No, I...

00:04:29.760 --> 00:04:33.120
Liza, somebody... incredible... came!

00:04:33.600 --> 00:04:35.200
I can't deal with them myself!

00:04:35.200 --> 00:04:35.880
Help!

00:04:35.200 --> 00:04:36.580
Meat!

00:04:36.580 --> 00:04:38.210
More meat!

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:39.200
Growl!

00:04:39.200 --> 00:04:40.340
C-Coming right up!

00:04:41.810 --> 00:04:45.880
She keeps ordering meat, and she's 
eating faster than I can cook it!

00:04:45.880 --> 00:04:48.100
She even eats the stuff I give 
her that isn't fully cooked yet!

00:04:48.100 --> 00:04:50.150
At this rate, we'll just run out of meat!

00:04:50.150 --> 00:04:52.600
Can you get me more from somewhere?

00:04:53.190 --> 00:04:55.740
Here's your ten yakitori skewers!

00:04:58.310 --> 00:04:59.950
Meat! More!

00:04:59.950 --> 00:05:02.380
Growl!

00:05:04.300 --> 00:05:07.380
If you're a bad girl,
then a scary person will come...

00:05:07.380 --> 00:05:10.830
...to turn you into 
reindeer stew and eat you!

00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:15.620
Um, can I have some blood?

00:05:17.240 --> 00:05:18.540
Welcome!

00:05:18.540 --> 00:05:20.160
What did you just say?

00:05:20.160 --> 00:05:21.800
No, please forget it.

00:05:21.800 --> 00:05:23.960
No, there's no way we're forgetting that!

00:05:23.960 --> 00:05:26.720
I swam a little too much, and...

00:05:26.720 --> 00:05:27.840
Blood...

00:05:27.840 --> 00:05:30.470
I need some blood soon, or I'll...

00:05:31.740 --> 00:05:33.930
Just a moment!

00:05:34.890 --> 00:05:36.280
What are you doing?

00:05:36.800 --> 00:05:39.140
Don't we work together at Branch Office #8?

00:05:39.140 --> 00:05:40.860
Are you even human?!

00:05:40.860 --> 00:05:42.500
I'm a witch!

00:05:42.500 --> 00:05:43.980
From the Blood Realm!

00:05:43.980 --> 00:05:46.280
She must be a member of 
the Witch's Association!

00:05:46.280 --> 00:05:48.360
She won't leave until she gets some blood!

00:05:46.280 --> 00:05:48.360
Meat! Meat! More meat!

00:05:48.680 --> 00:05:50.530
We need to do this to rebuild 
the Branch Office.

00:05:50.530 --> 00:05:51.640
Got it, Gajeru?

00:05:51.640 --> 00:05:53.580
Stop!

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:54.540
Meat! Meat!

00:05:54.540 --> 00:05:56.040
Blood... Blood...

00:05:56.040 --> 00:05:59.880
<i>Hell! This is a tropical hell!</i>

00:06:00.260 --> 00:06:04.650
<i>These must be the scary people 
I heard about when I was a kid!</i>

00:06:04.650 --> 00:06:06.340
<i>At this rate, I'll...</i>

00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:07.670
<i>Blood!</i>

00:06:07.670 --> 00:06:08.760
<i>Meat!</i>

00:06:09.690 --> 00:06:10.880
Hurry!

00:06:10.880 --> 00:06:13.720
Or I'll be turned into reindeer stew!

00:06:14.930 --> 00:06:16.680
A lifeguard, huh?

00:06:16.680 --> 00:06:17.890
That's a big responsibility!

00:06:18.340 --> 00:06:20.150
I need to stay alert!

00:06:21.710 --> 00:06:23.580
Choco, when did you get here?

00:06:23.580 --> 00:06:25.860
It's dangerous to climb up here.

00:06:26.090 --> 00:06:27.880
Is this what a girl is?

00:06:27.880 --> 00:06:29.700
It's so shiny!

00:06:31.100 --> 00:06:33.050
You mean that swimsuit?

00:06:33.050 --> 00:06:35.370
Yeah, it does look good on you.

00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:36.400
Thwack!

00:06:35.620 --> 00:06:36.080
<b>Thwack</b>

00:06:37.150 --> 00:06:38.520
Haru, you pervert.

00:06:38.520 --> 00:06:40.340
Focus on your work.

00:06:40.340 --> 00:06:41.250
I'm sorry...

00:06:41.870 --> 00:06:43.270
<i>What's with her?</i>

00:06:43.270 --> 00:06:46.960
<i>Choco was being weird and 
I just tried to play along.</i>

00:06:47.760 --> 00:06:49.010
What's wrong, Miu?

00:06:52.720 --> 00:06:53.430
That's...

00:06:54.350 --> 00:06:58.090
Hey! Stop being scared and jump already!

00:06:58.090 --> 00:06:59.240
No! No!

00:06:59.240 --> 00:07:00.840
I'm too scared!

00:07:00.840 --> 00:07:05.930
A teacher shouldn't be so indecisive.

00:07:05.930 --> 00:07:08.190
Terror... Despair...

00:07:08.190 --> 00:07:10.490
These things are, in their own way,
 very similar to hope...

00:07:10.490 --> 00:07:13.720
But I don't have to jump from these rocks...

00:07:13.720 --> 00:07:15.660
Stop looking and jump!

00:07:38.600 --> 00:07:39.700
Are you okay?

00:07:39.700 --> 00:07:41.170
Wake up!

00:07:41.170 --> 00:07:42.710
Are you okay?

00:07:43.710 --> 00:07:45.520
So this is a girl, huh?

00:07:45.520 --> 00:07:46.570
It's so soft...

00:07:48.080 --> 00:07:50.740
Choco, look at this!

00:07:50.740 --> 00:07:52.930
Your swimsuit did the same thing.

00:07:52.930 --> 00:07:53.240
Huh?

00:07:59.840 --> 00:08:00.840
Who are you?

00:08:00.840 --> 00:08:03.650
Um, a lifeguard!

00:08:03.650 --> 00:08:07.680
I saw you up on those rocks 
and got a little worried.

00:08:07.680 --> 00:08:10.240
Huh? I-It wasn't like that!

00:08:10.240 --> 00:08:13.440
Anyway, thank you for saving me!

00:08:13.440 --> 00:08:14.980
No...

00:08:17.080 --> 00:08:20.450
Love is sweet, and love is gentle!

00:08:20.450 --> 00:08:23.520
How about some Liebe dich Frau ice cream?

00:08:25.080 --> 00:08:27.300
Jeez, that Lindt and Milka...

00:08:27.300 --> 00:08:31.010
They're making me do the work 
while they enjoy a vacation!

00:08:31.010 --> 00:08:33.260
It's really pissing me off!

00:08:33.260 --> 00:08:35.360
I'll take one...

00:08:40.850 --> 00:08:45.000
Meldia, okay, okay, is it okay?

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:46.220
You never leave your room,

00:08:46.220 --> 00:08:48.670
but now you've come all the 
way to the Neutral Realm,

00:08:48.670 --> 00:08:51.880
and now you're eating ice cream 
you've never tried before!

00:08:51.880 --> 00:08:58.680
You said I had to leave the mansion once
 in a while and dragged me here, Aleitia.

00:08:59.020 --> 00:09:02.080
I haven't gone outside since that last call.

00:09:02.080 --> 00:09:05.910
And when it's this hot, you need 
some ice cream just to keep going.

00:09:05.910 --> 00:09:08.210
Seriously? You'll buy some?

00:09:08.210 --> 00:09:11.460
I've got the perfect
 ice cream flavors for you!

00:09:11.460 --> 00:09:13.040
Lemon and rose!

00:09:13.040 --> 00:09:15.520
Lemon helps with Alzheimer's!

00:09:15.520 --> 00:09:18.990
Oh, my! Rose flavor! How wonderful!

00:09:20.220 --> 00:09:23.200
<i>What's important isn't
 the flavor, it's the effects.</i>

00:09:23.200 --> 00:09:26.240
<i>That ice cream contains the 
result of years of research,</i>

00:09:26.240 --> 00:09:28.750
<i>a powerful love spell!</i>

00:09:28.750 --> 00:09:31.420
<i>If you eat it, you'll fall 
in love immediately!</i>

00:09:31.420 --> 00:09:33.510
<i>Come on, eat! Eat!</i>

00:09:34.880 --> 00:09:36.430
So this is a girl, huh?

00:09:36.430 --> 00:09:38.300
It's so slippery and wet!

00:09:38.720 --> 00:09:40.390
Mine's all slick!

00:09:42.010 --> 00:09:46.910
Huh, Aleitia, did you just 
say something naughty?

00:09:46.910 --> 00:09:49.610
And that was very indecent, Meldia.

00:09:49.960 --> 00:09:52.530
<i>Did I use the wrong potion?</i>

00:09:55.320 --> 00:09:57.040
Choco!

00:09:57.040 --> 00:09:58.970
There you are!

00:09:58.970 --> 00:10:03.020
Don't run off like that! You had me worried!

00:10:03.760 --> 00:10:05.530
I was hungry.

00:10:05.530 --> 00:10:07.550
Oh, fine.

00:10:07.550 --> 00:10:09.990
Excuse me. I'll take two.

00:10:09.990 --> 00:10:11.070
Thanks!

00:10:11.070 --> 00:10:14.350
I've got the perfect ice 
cream flavor for you... Here!

00:10:14.350 --> 00:10:15.420
Chocolate vanilla swirl!

00:10:16.280 --> 00:10:17.130
<i>This time!</i>

00:10:17.430 --> 00:10:21.720
<i>This ice cream's got two 
separate kinds of magic in it!</i>

00:10:21.720 --> 00:10:24.430
<i>If they eat it, they should 
fall in love immediately!</i>

00:10:24.430 --> 00:10:26.520
<i>Love on the beach... nonstop!</i>

00:10:27.160 --> 00:10:30.730
<i>The two are sure to get closer immediately!</i>

00:10:30.730 --> 00:10:32.360
Well, Choco? Is it good?

00:10:32.360 --> 00:10:33.190
Thwack!

00:10:32.730 --> 00:10:33.190
<b>Thwack</b>

00:10:33.750 --> 00:10:35.690
Yeah, it's pretty good.

00:10:38.380 --> 00:10:43.910
<i>I guess I still have a bunch of work 
to do to finish my love magic.</i>

00:10:44.670 --> 00:10:49.000
E-Excuse me, can you repeat that order again?

00:10:49.310 --> 00:10:52.710
I can pick out my own food, Sister.

00:10:52.990 --> 00:10:54.880
O-Of course...

00:10:54.880 --> 00:10:56.550
So, about that order...

00:10:56.810 --> 00:10:58.930
Sis, you're way too overprotective.

00:10:58.930 --> 00:11:00.540
I'll pick something.

00:11:00.540 --> 00:11:03.760
Also, I'm not your sister...

00:11:03.760 --> 00:11:06.410
I'm definitely a guy, for one thing...

00:11:06.410 --> 00:11:08.750
That's what you want, Sister.

00:11:08.750 --> 00:11:12.160
Respect what I want for once, would you?

00:11:14.680 --> 00:11:18.830
I can't take it anymore!

00:11:19.340 --> 00:11:21.710
What part of this place 
is a "peaceful resort"?

00:11:21.710 --> 00:11:24.180
I'm here to enjoy a vacation with everyone!

00:11:24.180 --> 00:11:26.450
So why do I have to deal with weird 
girls who talk to themselves

00:11:26.450 --> 00:11:29.800
or carnivorous girls with
bottomless stomachs?!

00:11:29.800 --> 00:11:32.780
To make things even worse,
 Liza almost took all my blood!

00:11:32.780 --> 00:11:34.880
I hate you, you stupid beach!

00:11:34.880 --> 00:11:36.030
No complaining.

00:11:36.030 --> 00:11:38.050
Give me a nice, sexy pose.

00:11:38.330 --> 00:11:40.240
Fine...

00:11:40.240 --> 00:11:41.400
Like this?

00:11:42.280 --> 00:11:43.070
Yeah!

00:11:43.070 --> 00:11:44.710
I-Is that...?

00:11:47.570 --> 00:11:50.310
Muu-san, one of <i>Monthly
Witchy-Witch</i>'s top models!

00:11:50.310 --> 00:11:53.200
More! Bolder!

00:11:53.200 --> 00:11:55.400
That's right! You can do it if you try!

00:11:56.930 --> 00:11:59.410
I'm getting bored.

00:11:59.410 --> 00:12:01.570
Anthem, can we take a break?

00:12:01.890 --> 00:12:04.700
Dia-san, the founder of <i>Witchy-Witch</i>!

00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:05.280
Which means...

00:12:05.280 --> 00:12:07.360
Astrea Anthem's the name.

00:12:07.360 --> 00:12:08.510
This may just be for fun,

00:12:08.510 --> 00:12:10.360
but I agreed to be your photographer,

00:12:10.360 --> 00:12:13.820
so I'm going to take the best photos I can!

00:12:14.320 --> 00:12:16.810
Hey, Sapphire, are you ready yet?

00:12:16.810 --> 00:12:18.250
Sapph—

00:12:18.560 --> 00:12:20.140
Hang on...

00:12:20.140 --> 00:12:25.280
D-Do I really have to wear a 
revealing swimsuit like this?

00:12:26.150 --> 00:12:28.600
It's pretty embarrassing.

00:12:29.500 --> 00:12:30.310
I...

00:12:32.550 --> 00:12:33.380
I...

00:12:36.910 --> 00:12:37.650
I...

00:12:41.390 --> 00:12:44.450
I...!

00:12:45.760 --> 00:12:46.740
Missile launch confirmed!

00:12:47.280 --> 00:12:48.920
It's not one of ours.

00:12:48.920 --> 00:12:50.150
Calm down.

00:12:50.150 --> 00:12:52.080
That's not a missile.

00:12:52.080 --> 00:12:54.460
Just a beastman who's having 
a little too much fun.

00:12:56.000 --> 00:12:59.410
A flying beastman, huh? That's funny.

00:12:59.410 --> 00:13:02.680
I guess you can see all kinds of 
things here in the Neutral Realm.

00:13:02.680 --> 00:13:05.500
It's hot! Can I take this off?

00:13:05.500 --> 00:13:07.960
You've got nothing else to take off!

00:13:07.960 --> 00:13:09.150
That's right!

00:13:09.150 --> 00:13:09.850
We're the ones...

00:13:11.300 --> 00:13:12.980
...who'll be taking our clothes off!

00:13:14.070 --> 00:13:15.570
Okay, everyone!

00:13:15.570 --> 00:13:19.050
Time to begin our military exercises!
 Remember, safety first!

00:13:21.580 --> 00:13:22.570
I'll defeat...

00:13:22.570 --> 00:13:24.990
...these spirals!

00:13:23.990 --> 00:13:24.990
<b>~ the journey to the end of the despair ~</b>

00:13:25.640 --> 00:13:27.000
Come, spirals!

00:13:27.000 --> 00:13:28.990
I'll be the one to defeat you!

00:13:27.990 --> 00:13:28.990
<b>~ the journey to the end of the despair ~</b>

00:13:30.200 --> 00:13:32.520
This wind! These waves!

00:13:32.520 --> 00:13:35.830
I've missed surfing so much!

00:13:37.020 --> 00:13:37.720
He's so wonderful!

00:13:37.720 --> 00:13:38.770
Look over here!

00:13:38.770 --> 00:13:44.510
If you show off too much, you'll get 
eaten by a shark, Uncle Gilled!

00:13:44.510 --> 00:13:47.590
You can tell me what to do once you 
don't need a swim ring anymore!

00:13:48.870 --> 00:13:51.030
Hey, Celeas, is that...

00:13:51.030 --> 00:13:52.930
Yes, he's quite good, isn't he?

00:13:53.940 --> 00:13:56.390
Let's see what he's got.

00:14:04.150 --> 00:14:05.440
He might be really good!

00:14:05.440 --> 00:14:06.820
Not bad...

00:14:15.200 --> 00:14:16.680
He might be really good...

00:14:17.430 --> 00:14:20.860
I'm off to go have a bit more fun.

00:14:22.880 --> 00:14:24.260
There we go...

00:14:27.120 --> 00:14:29.110
So this is a girl, huh?

00:14:29.110 --> 00:14:30.840
So full of energy!

00:14:33.160 --> 00:14:36.390
Chloe... I didn't know you 
thought of me that way!

00:14:36.730 --> 00:14:38.560
You've got it all wrong!

00:14:38.560 --> 00:14:39.320
I just meant...

00:14:39.320 --> 00:14:41.920
It's okay. It's okay.

00:14:41.920 --> 00:14:45.190
Everybody has their own tastes, but...

00:14:45.190 --> 00:14:46.940
So bouncy!

00:14:47.220 --> 00:14:48.860
C-Celeas...

00:14:48.860 --> 00:14:49.670
Was that...

00:14:49.670 --> 00:14:51.080
N-No!

00:14:51.080 --> 00:14:53.400
I didn't mean it...

00:14:53.400 --> 00:14:56.680
Girls are so... soft!

00:14:58.440 --> 00:14:59.360
Our wings, right?

00:14:59.360 --> 00:15:02.770
We're some of the prettiest girls 
in the Sky Realm, after all!

00:15:08.430 --> 00:15:10.380
See, you should've listened.

00:15:10.380 --> 00:15:12.430
That's what you get for showing off.

00:15:12.430 --> 00:15:14.060
Shaddup.

00:15:15.420 --> 00:15:17.470
Hey, is that you, Haru?

00:15:17.470 --> 00:15:18.720
Brother Gilled?

00:15:18.720 --> 00:15:20.070
And Noin!

00:15:20.070 --> 00:15:21.760
What are you doing here?

00:15:22.380 --> 00:15:26.440
We're here to work off some of the 
stress from being at HQ all day.

00:15:26.440 --> 00:15:28.530
What are you doing here, Brother?

00:15:28.530 --> 00:15:31.120
Why are you dressed like a lifeguard?

00:15:31.120 --> 00:15:33.910
Well, a lot happened...

00:15:33.910 --> 00:15:35.050
Oh, no!

00:15:35.050 --> 00:15:37.610
I have to get back to work!

00:15:37.610 --> 00:15:38.500
Did something happen?

00:15:38.500 --> 00:15:41.970
Someone just re-entered the atmosphere!

00:15:41.970 --> 00:15:43.250
The atmosphere...?

00:15:43.250 --> 00:15:44.540
Re-entered?

00:15:46.270 --> 00:15:48.230
Excuse me!

00:15:48.230 --> 00:15:51.370
Can I get through?

00:15:52.760 --> 00:15:53.930
Gajeru!

00:15:53.930 --> 00:15:55.790
Gajeru, hang in there!

00:15:55.790 --> 00:15:58.800
We were doing some photos 
for <i>Monthly Witchy-Witch</i>

00:15:58.800 --> 00:16:00.640
when he suddenly fell down from the sky.

00:16:00.640 --> 00:16:01.920
Dia-san!

00:16:01.920 --> 00:16:03.230
Fancy seeing you here.

00:16:03.230 --> 00:16:04.850
Do you know this pile of ash?

00:16:05.790 --> 00:16:06.970
Hello?

00:16:06.970 --> 00:16:08.240
Are you okay?

00:16:08.240 --> 00:16:09.690
Hello?

00:16:11.210 --> 00:16:12.920
This girl is my type.

00:16:12.920 --> 00:16:13.660
She's the best.

00:16:16.490 --> 00:16:17.330
Gajeru...

00:16:17.890 --> 00:16:20.160
What did I just say?

00:16:22.160 --> 00:16:22.750
Gajeru...

00:16:26.970 --> 00:16:29.920
Gajeru!

00:16:38.720 --> 00:16:41.950
Oh my, that's quite the welcome.

00:16:43.560 --> 00:16:45.460
That's nice to see.

00:16:45.460 --> 00:16:47.650
It's hot! Can I take my clothes off?

00:16:48.620 --> 00:16:53.320
I'm Balzac, Commander of the 
Spar Realm's Sturm Fleet.

00:16:53.320 --> 00:16:56.600
We're about to do a military 
exercise in this area!

00:16:56.600 --> 00:16:59.010
It will be dangerous, so go
play in another area!

00:16:59.010 --> 00:17:00.600
A military exercise?

00:17:00.600 --> 00:17:03.200
The Neutral Realm is supposed 
to a place of peace!

00:17:03.200 --> 00:17:05.530
To teach children to swim!

00:17:05.530 --> 00:17:07.610
To sell ice cream that makes you fall in love!

00:17:07.610 --> 00:17:09.710
To take swimsuit photos!

00:17:09.710 --> 00:17:12.050
We need to take a stand here.

00:17:12.050 --> 00:17:13.430
Go home.

00:17:13.890 --> 00:17:15.180
Y-You're...

00:17:16.360 --> 00:17:20.040
That's Fiora-sama, the young 
ruler of the Huma Realm!

00:17:20.040 --> 00:17:22.280
Everybody's having a good time.

00:17:22.280 --> 00:17:24.840
Fighting is out of the question.

00:17:24.840 --> 00:17:29.860
Turn that nasty-looking hunk of junk 
around and head back to the Spar Realm!

00:17:31.760 --> 00:17:36.750
You say that, but you like fighting, too!

00:17:36.750 --> 00:17:38.150
I'm sorry...

00:17:38.150 --> 00:17:41.530
If we go back without using our ammunition,
 we'll have some problems...

00:17:41.530 --> 00:17:43.040
Fine. I get it.

00:17:43.040 --> 00:17:44.970
Everyone, get them.

00:17:44.970 --> 00:17:47.080
Hey, calm down.

00:17:47.080 --> 00:17:51.340
Right now, your big sis Aferola 
is the only one here with you.

00:17:51.900 --> 00:17:53.100
You there.

00:17:53.100 --> 00:17:57.580
What are you thinking, coming all 
the way to the Neutral Realm?

00:17:57.580 --> 00:18:00.620
There's plenty of room in your 
own seas to do exercises.

00:18:00.620 --> 00:18:03.180
We need to do exercises in 
the Neutral Realm as well.

00:18:03.470 --> 00:18:07.920
We just saw a weird beastman 
flying off like a missile.

00:18:07.920 --> 00:18:11.050
He'll come back as a spiral.

00:18:11.050 --> 00:18:13.900
We should practice, so we're 
ready to intercept him!

00:18:14.220 --> 00:18:16.240
If you're looking for me, I'm right here!

00:18:17.260 --> 00:18:20.270
No matter how hard you try 
to make that sound plausible...

00:18:20.270 --> 00:18:23.040
...you can't do any exercises here.

00:18:23.040 --> 00:18:27.680
Don't you know the law of this realm, 
the Neutral Realm Constitution?

00:18:27.680 --> 00:18:31.830
Article 1, "The Neutral Realm 
is permanently neutral."

00:18:31.830 --> 00:18:35.340
Article 2, "The use of force 
is strictly prohibited."

00:18:35.340 --> 00:18:42.140
Oh, you didn't know that they're 
about to add a third article to it?

00:18:42.140 --> 00:18:46.360
Article 3, "However, this does 
not apply to military exercises."

00:18:46.360 --> 00:18:48.510
It's going to be submitted in 
the next parliament meeting,

00:18:48.510 --> 00:18:50.190
and the citizens will vote on it.

00:18:50.540 --> 00:18:52.600
The parliament won't approve it,

00:18:52.600 --> 00:18:54.520
and the citizens won't vote for it, either.

00:18:55.270 --> 00:19:02.070
Military exercises and experiments have 
been used to justify many wars in the past.

00:19:02.070 --> 00:19:04.530
Each time that's happened, 
much blood has been shed,

00:19:04.530 --> 00:19:06.420
and the people have been the ones to suffer.

00:19:07.240 --> 00:19:10.000
If it comes to a war,

00:19:10.540 --> 00:19:12.670
I, Fiora Huma Realm Estoria,

00:19:13.060 --> 00:19:15.660
will destroy you all with my sword alone!

00:19:15.660 --> 00:19:18.750
But if that happens, the vow that 
protects this island will be broken,

00:19:18.750 --> 00:19:21.200
and the peace will end.

00:19:21.200 --> 00:19:23.270
I'll never do that,

00:19:23.270 --> 00:19:25.300
and I won't let you do it, either.

00:19:26.430 --> 00:19:27.780
Fiora-sama!

00:19:29.000 --> 00:19:32.380
And wait, why are you 
wearing swimsuits, anyway?

00:19:32.380 --> 00:19:35.240
Are you sure you guys just 
aren't here to have fun, too?

00:19:36.490 --> 00:19:37.350
You found out?

00:19:37.350 --> 00:19:39.500
Looks like she found out.

00:19:39.500 --> 00:19:40.760
What do we do?

00:19:40.760 --> 00:19:42.880
Go spread your platitudes somewhere else!

00:19:42.880 --> 00:19:47.320
If you refuse, we'll use 
our Sturm Cannons to...

00:19:47.320 --> 00:19:49.000
Loli-loli!

00:19:49.610 --> 00:19:50.680
Balzac...

00:19:50.680 --> 00:19:52.550
What are you talking about?

00:19:53.150 --> 00:19:54.570
Wh-What did I just...

00:19:55.280 --> 00:19:58.260
Looks like Fiora's speech drove you crazy.

00:19:58.260 --> 00:20:03.710
If you all insist on putting your 
own desires first, then I'm...

00:20:03.710 --> 00:20:06.400
...gonna get bouncy-bouncy!

00:20:06.400 --> 00:20:07.650
Hey, Sis!

00:20:07.650 --> 00:20:09.080
What are you doing? Showing off?

00:20:09.080 --> 00:20:11.220
No, I...

00:20:16.760 --> 00:20:20.100
Haru, you just touched my butt, didn't you?

00:20:20.100 --> 00:20:22.020
I-I did not!

00:20:22.020 --> 00:20:24.490
Oh, Haru! It's been forever!

00:20:30.280 --> 00:20:31.590
Moegi-sensei!

00:20:31.590 --> 00:20:32.810
What a coincidence.

00:20:32.810 --> 00:20:34.970
What are you doing here?

00:20:34.970 --> 00:20:37.760
What about you, Moegi-sensei?

00:20:37.760 --> 00:20:39.440
Killing time.

00:20:39.440 --> 00:20:41.840
I heard an interesting rumor.

00:20:41.840 --> 00:20:42.670
Rumor?

00:20:42.670 --> 00:20:46.890
I heard there's a spiral around 
here that haunts bathing suits.

00:20:46.890 --> 00:20:47.970
Bathing suits?

00:20:48.450 --> 00:20:52.160
It seems the despair of a boy who died 
without ever getting a girlfriend

00:20:52.160 --> 00:20:54.200
became a spiral.

00:20:54.200 --> 00:20:59.820
Once it's inside the swimsuit, it does all 
kinds of things to the girls wearing it.

00:20:59.820 --> 00:21:01.960
Th-That's horrible!

00:21:01.960 --> 00:21:06.880
And supposedly the spiral's voice 
comes out through the girl's mouth.

00:21:06.880 --> 00:21:10.290
We have to find it before 
somebody becomes a victim!

00:21:10.290 --> 00:21:12.180
Where is it?

00:21:12.970 --> 00:21:14.810
Moegi-sensei?

00:21:27.080 --> 00:21:28.600
There you are, spiral!

00:21:28.600 --> 00:21:29.970
Now, you'll fight us!

00:21:32.670 --> 00:21:33.920
No, don't look!

00:21:33.920 --> 00:21:35.070
Turn away!

00:21:35.070 --> 00:21:36.720
No one will marry me now!

00:21:36.720 --> 00:21:37.410
Oh, no!

00:21:37.410 --> 00:21:39.040
We have to do something!

00:21:39.040 --> 00:21:41.850
It's small! It's too small!

00:21:41.850 --> 00:21:44.690
How come I get a trash bag?!

00:21:48.520 --> 00:21:51.450
F... Freedom of Expression!

00:21:51.450 --> 00:21:55.960
Freedom of Thought!

00:21:56.960 --> 00:21:58.220
It disappeared.

00:22:01.680 --> 00:22:03.760
Ah, so peaceful.

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>Preview</b>

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>Episode 9
Expanding Galaxy</b>

00:23:36.640 --> 00:23:38.680
"Expanding Galaxy."
